{"id":"de3f2ba1fa9eb703","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness.md","title":"IL与ILM的Veltman可靠性","display":"thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness — IL与ILM的Veltman可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness"],"display":"thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness — IL与ILM的Veltman可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]","[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Lemma13.6(a),(c), print516/PDF528; full local semantic proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness — IL与ILM的Veltman可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e82291b3e069169\" href=\"?note=3e82291b3e069169\" title=\"72-df-veltman-forcing\">72-df-veltman-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137fba496ea55bfa\" href=\"?note=137fba496ea55bfa\" title=\"72-df-il-ilm-calculi\">72-df-il-ilm-calculi</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Lemma13.6(a),(c), print516/PDF528; full local semantic proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak V=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak V=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\\)</span> 为合法 Veltman 模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}}A\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak V\\models_I A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}}A\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak V\\models_I A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S)\\land\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ILM}}A\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak V\\models_I A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S)\\land\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ILM}}A\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak V\\models_I A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>K 和 Löb 的语义证明对任意子公式真值集合都适用。J1 用 S(w) 的反身性，令见证就是原后继；J2 对两次存在见证用 S(w) 传递性；J3 对真析取选支；J4 利用 S(w) 的定义域和值域都在 R[w] 中；J5 对 v 的 A 后继 u，用 R 的传递性与 R|R[w]⊆S(w)。验证 M：若 v 满足 A∧□C，先由 A▷B 得 vS(w)u 且 u满足B；MF使 u 的任意 R 后继也是 v 的 R 后继，故 u满足□C。MP、必然化保持全世界有效。对闭包阶段归纳完成两式。全部五条额外公理及 M 均实际检查，没有借用算术解释完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-veltman-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"3e82291b3e069169","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-il-ilm-calculi","status":"resolved","id":"137fba496ea55bfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak V=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\\vdash_{\\mathsf{IL}}A\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak V\\models_I A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S)\\land\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ILM}}A\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak V\\models_I A.","display":true}],"bytes":1756,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-